id=dumbdown_bootanim
name=DumbDown Boot Animation
version=v1.0.0
versionCode=1
author=amber
description=Replaces the stock TCL boot animation with the offlineinc/DumbDown one shipped inside the launcher APK (240x320, 12fps). Installs systemlessly to /product/media/bootanimation.zip via system/product, so the stock file is untouched and removing the module restores it.
